## Interface: 16001, 16002, 16003, 16100, 16101, 16200
## Title: Quiet Friends
## Category: Quiet
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Letter_15
## Notes: Your friends' full character names (first name and surname, as WoW Forever has them), with a note on who each one is. When you write a letter, they're listed beside the mail: a click puts the name in To. Each character sees the friends saved on its own server and faction, the ones mail can reach. /qfriends opens the list; /qfriends help for every command. Its settings are in Options, AddOns, Quiet.
